text.en:
The Municipality of Sto. Niño shall be bounded as follows:
Beginning from point 1 on the Surallah-Banga boundary barrio of Teresita;
Thence, going Southwest following the old boundary of Banga-Surallah to point 2 at intersection of Allah
Thence, following the course of Allah River in the Northwesterly direction to point 3 (Intersection of Allah
River and farm road, Northeastern corner of Lot 283, Pls-258-D, Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, going directly West following the farm road until it meets Sepaka River to point 4 (Intersection of
Sepaka River and Northwestern corner of Lot 638, Pls-585-D, Map of Surallah, South Cotabato);
Thence, following the course of the Sepaka River in a Northeasterly direction to point 5 (Junction of Allah
River and Sepaka River);
Thence, following the course of Allah River in a Northwesterly direction to point 6 (Intersection of Allah
River and farm road, Northwestern corner of Lot 1774, Pls-406-D, Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, following the farm road in a Southeastern direction to point 7 (Northeastern corner of Lot 715,
Pls-212-D, Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, following the farm road in a Southwestern direction to point 8 (Southeastern corner of Lot 736 and
Southwestern corner of Lot 745, all of Pls-212-D, Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, going in the Southeastern direction in a straight line to point 9 (Northeastern corner of Lot 349,
Pls-406-D, Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, following the farm road in the Southwestern direction to point 10 (Southeastern corner of Lot 426,
Pls-406-D, Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, going in the Southeastern direction to point 11 (Northeastern corner of Lot 442, Pls-212-D, Map of
Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, following the farm road in a Southwestern direction to point 12 (Southeastern corner of Lot 442,
Pls-212-D Map of Norala, South Cotabato);
Thence, going in Southeastern direction in a straight line to point 13 to intersect with the old Norala-Banga
boundary line;
Thence, going in Southwestern direction following the old Norala-Banga boundary line to point 14 (Old
boundary point of Norala and Banga near the barrio of Sto. Niño);
Thence, the following the farm road in a Southeastern direction till it reaches the point of beginning near the
barrio of Teresita.
